      <fieldset class="tui-window">
        <legend class="tui-title">cat ~/bio/Untitled.md</legend>
        <p>
          <strong>Haii!!</strong> :3<br>
          My name is Maya <em>(this month at least, I'm indecisive as fuck)</em> and I use she/her pronouns.<br>
          Im a nerdy transfemme teenage girl who's interested in programming, video games, and art/drawing (and I overuse :3 mrrp!).
        </p>
      </fieldset>
      <div class="row">
        <fieldset class="tui-window" style="flex-grow: 2; flex-basis: 0;">
          <legend class="tui-title">cat ~/bio/interests-and-hobbies.md</legend>
          <p>
            <!-- <span class="comment">&lt;!-- ... --&gt;</span> -->
            * Programming and CS in general<br>
            &emsp;&emsp;* I mainly like coding stuff that doesn't serve much of a purpose <span class="comment">&lt;!-- e.g. a gravity sim, oh I need to finish that <span emoji="oop"></span> --&gt;</span> <br>
            &emsp;&emsp;* I've also dabbled in <a href="https://ericyd.hashnode.dev/if-you-can-code-then-make-art-else-return-false">generative art</a> <em>(NOT AI "ART")</em> <br>
            &emsp;&emsp;* I've gone through maining a couple languages over the years, I'm currently using rust <span emoji="ferris-explode"></span> (which is <em>not</em> a cult <span emoji="wink2"></span>, <i>FUCK C++</i>) which I'm currently enjoying <br>
            &emsp;&emsp;* This website is my first real project in webdev/html and it's been pretty fun so far!<br>
            * I'm a programmer on my school's FRC Robotics team
            <span class="comment">&lt;!-- i'd say my team number but I don't wanna dox myself <span emoji="orphanage"></span> --&gt;</span> <br>
            * I like to do a little art sometimes but I'm not very good <br>
            &emsp;&emsp;* I love working with charcoal and pen <br>
            &emsp;&emsp;* Oil pastels seem fun but I think anything I try to do will be overshadowed by a freind of mine who's really, <em>really</em>, <i>REALLY</i> good <span emoji="sobspin"></span>
            <span class="comment">&lt;!-- hi, Gabriel --&gt;</span> <br>
            &emsp;&emsp;* I've played around with blender a lil bit but that's about all I've done digitally <br>
            &emsp;&emsp;* You can see some of my best stuff on my portfolio page <br>
            * I like to play video games, my favorite genres are: <br>
            &emsp;&emsp;* metroidvanias <br>
            &emsp;&emsp;* "walking simulators" <span class="comment">&lt;!-- I hate that name almost as much as I do "freindslop" btw, I'll prolaby write smth about it at some point --&gt;</span> <br>
